blurb = "Depicts Uwan, a yōkai that was first considered to be a disembodied voice shouting \"uwan!\" at people in the dark, especially in old homes and abandoned temples. Edo-period interpretations give this disembodied voice as physical form. Mentions of this yōkai are believed to have originated in Aomori prefecture."
